(FYI) The proposed Plat does not show detached sidewalks. The UDC, chapter 4.3
requires a detached sidewalk with a 7 ft. tree lawn between the sidewalk and the curb
for residential streets. Detached sidewalks with street trees improve quality of life for
residents, increases property values and reduces maintenance for sidewalks and streets.
